{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/86520-demons-make-their-own-infrastructures","id":86520,"title":"Demons make their own infrastructures?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-07T23:23:13-08:00","id":86520,"title":"Demons make their own infrastructures?","content":"I really wish there was a way for demons to make their own infrastructures. I know we can take over an infrastructure from the god machine, but I would really prefer to see demons create their own and be able to put their own personality into it. It has been a while, but something like what a Demesnes is to mage, a place where demons are more powerful, the laws of reality are altered, and the original purpose of the place and been changed in some way that serves the demon like its own occult matrix. They might follow the GM example and piggyback on a mortal structure, or it might be something completely separate and unique.<br /> <br /> Anything from the Lemarchand's box from hellraiser, that drags people into its pocket dimension 'hell' to suffer torment which is part of a occult matrix that feeds off suffering for some purpose of the demons, to the police box of doctor who that sends people to locations and times that 'they need to be', to a school setting that guarantees to turn troubled kids into perfect kids, oh, forgot to mention that they will be implanted with a chip that would turn the kids into perfect kids, cultists, and use all that extra brain power for an organic super computer, to a marriage counselor building strait from stepford wives, where one of the spouses go into a room and screams come from, along with weird machine sounds and a few seconds later a new and improved version of the spouse comes out of a different door. Better in every way, just do not look too closely at what lies underneath the skin. What happened to the original? Well, parts for new models have to come from somewhere, not to mention the machinery needs to be fed. What does the demon get? The machine can make all sorts of people, it just needs fuel (feed) For every person fed to the machine, it can make two people, one for the spouse, the other for the demon if he needs a loyal disposable thrall (and who doesn't need a disposable thrall really?). <br /> <br /> Stuff like this would be cool","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2356-badmojo","name":"Badmojo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T04:01:12-07:00","id":87405,"title":"","content":"From what I read in the preview, the Psychopomps were instrumental in creating Infrastructure for the God Machine. Whether or not they can still do this, after they Fall, is up to the Corebook or future books if not explained throughly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T06:02:52-07:00","id":87447,"title":"","content":"Personally I've made infrastructure part of the ciphers.<br /> Split the stuff into four different &quot;groups&quot;. Infrastructure, form, boon and embed/exploit.<br /> The last one is self-explanatory, as is, I hope, form (you get a new thing to select for your demonic form), boon is a bit less so, but in effect it's a passive benefit that is always available to the demon, even while in cover, and architecture are sorts of buildings demons can build themselves, but which is slightly different. First off, it uses Aether, it doesn't produce it (or it produces it but at a noticeable price), if it runs out of aether it stops working, and it can is usually something the demon could benefit from having more than one of.<br /> <br /> If that isn't your cup of tea, well, you could treat is as very large gadgets, possibly requiring specialized embeds/exploits just for the purpose, or perhaps merely do like exploits, it requires <i>some</i> excuse but is otherwise fairly open. As for balance, just throw a merit dot cost on it, problem solved. (or some other expense, maybe a willpower dot?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1734-asaram","name":"Asaram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1734_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"331"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}